        "title": "Language: SQL",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Relational algebra operators → SQL surface syntax:\n    σ (selection)     → WHERE\n    π (projection)    → SELECT col1, col2\n    ⋈ (join)          → JOIN\n    γ (grouping/agg)  → GROUP BY + aggregate functions\n    ∪ (union)         → UNION\n    − (difference)    → EXCEPT\n    ∩ (intersection)  → INTERSECT\n```"
